# Done Criteria Rules

A frontend change is complete only when:

- `pnpm build` and `pnpm typecheck` pass
- No new TypeScript/lint regressions in touched files
- API calls use shared fetcher path
- i18n updates exist for both locales when copy changes
- Navigation and route behavior match implementation state
